          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ജീവൻ (jīvan) is borrowed from Sanskrit jīva, \"living; a living being, life\" (CDIAL 5239), the root of ജീവിക്കുക (jīvikkuka), \"to live\"."
            }
